* An address passed for a parameter the body uses only as an address operand (START 256 with
* move.l a5,\1): absolute long, as a bare address is in r68; as took the small number for a short
* one. (A parameter also used otherwise, #\1, is left alone: still short there, where r68 makes
* it long.)
* fixed: ae073c7 2026-10-11 r68togas: addresses passed to address parameters are long
* expect text: 23cd0000 01004e71
START macro
 move.l a5,\1
 endm
 psect mem_param,0,0,0,0,0
 START 256
 ends
